306 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/Alt (Reference architecture. Core systems, staff and share-link users reach a stateless necodoc API through your load balancer. The API stores templates, logs, the audit log and the job queue in your Postgres, and issues signed links to PDFs in your object storage. Render workers claim jobs from Postgres, render with headless Chromium and write PDFs to storage. Sign-in goes through your identity provider; metrics, traces and logs go to your observability stack. Outside the trust boundary, and optional: webhooks to your endpoints, your e-sign provider integration, and the Anthropic API only when AI is enabled.)
/P 124 0 R
/Pg 37 0 R
/K 4
>>
endobj

